Package: patrone-terminal
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, fonts-jetbrains-mono
Recommends: patrone-shell-config
Provides: x-terminal-emulator
Description: terminal emulator for PatroneOS
 Patrone Terminal is the default terminal of PatroneOS, built on GTK 4
 and VTE. It copies selected text to the clipboard, pastes with a
 right-click, opens links with Ctrl+click, and has tabs and a dark theme in
 the Patrone colors.
